flowchart LR
    DEV[Developer workstation]
    PC[pre-commit hooks]
    GH[GitHub Repository]
    GHA[GitHub Actions]
    DH[Docker Hub]
    ARGO[Argo CD]
    SLACK[Slack]

    DEV -->|git commit| PC
    PC -->|commit allowed| DEV
    DEV -->|git push| GH

    GH -->|trigger CI| GHA
    GHA -->|tests / build / lint| GHA
    GHA -->|build + push images| DH
    GHA -->|update manifests in Git| GH
    GHA -->|CI notifications| SLACK

    ARGO -->|pull desired state from Git| GH
    ARGO -->|apply manifests| K8S[Kubernetes / Minikube]

    subgraph K8S
      FE[Frontend]
      BE[Backend]
      DB[(PostgreSQL)]
      PROM[Prometheus]
      GRAF[Grafana]
      ALRT[Alertmanager]
    end

    FE -->|/api| BE
    BE --> DB
    PROM -->|scrape /metrics| BE
    ALRT -->|alert webhook| SLACK
